'''Cornelia''' (コーネリア) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cornelia
|image = E 164.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 300¢ - 1,185¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a medium-type peon with moderate health and range but ridiculously low attack power. It shouldn't pose much of a threat at all simply due to its terrible offensive abilities.

==Strategy==
Corenlia mostly just serves as a tank which can be easily cleared with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or other units with high damage.

